    "title": "`RCLCPP_PUBLIC [[deprecated]]` fails to build on debian12+gcc12",
    "url": "https://github.com/ros2/rclcpp/issues/3191",
    "body": "### Generated by Generative AI\n\n_No response_\n\n### Operating System:\n\n```debian12```\n\n### ROS version or commit hash:\n\nlyrical, rolling\n\n### RMW implementation (if applicable):\n\n_No response_\n\n### RMW Configuration (if applicable):\n\n_No response_\n\n### Client library (if applicable):\n\n_No response_\n\n### 'ros2 doctor --report' output\n\n_No response_\n\n### Steps to reproduce issue\n\nSource build of rclcpp, like I maintain with this dockerfile\nhttps://github.com/ros-controls/ros2_control_ci/actions/workflows/build_and_publish_debian_docker.yaml\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nClean build\n\n### Actual behavior\n\n```\n#18 2137.3 In file included from /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/src/rclcpp/memory_strategy.cpp:15:\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:42:21: error: expected identifier before ‘[’ token\n#18 2137.3    42 | class RCLCPP_PUBLIC [[deprecated(\"The executor does not used this anymore\")]] MemoryStrategy\n#18 2137.3       |                     ^\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:42:21: warning: attribute ignored [-Wattributes]\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:42:21: note: an attribute that appertains to a type-specifier is ignored\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:44:1: error: expected primary-expression before ‘public’\n#18 2137.3    44 | public:\n#18 2137.3       | ^~~~~~\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:44:1: error: expected ‘}’ before ‘public’\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:43:1: note: to match this ‘{’\n#18 2137.3    43 | {\n#18 2137.3       | ^\n```\n\n\n### Additional information\n\nDeprecation warning was added with #3136. Removing the deprecation warning, and it builds correctly\n\ndebian12:\n```\ngcc --version\ngcc (Debian 12.2.0-14+deb12u1) 12.2.0\n```",
