\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:44:1: error: expected primary-expression before ‘public’\n#18 2137.3    44 | public:\n#18 2137.3       | ^~~~~~\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:44:1: error: expected ‘}’ before ‘public’\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:43:1: note: to match this ‘{’\n#18 2137.3    43 | {\n#18 2137.3       | ^\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">#18 2137.3 In file included from /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/src/rclcpp/memory_strategy.cpp:15:\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:42:21: error: expected identifier before ‘[’ token\n#18 2137.3    42 | class RCLCPP_PUBLIC [[deprecated(\"The executor does not used this anymore\")]] MemoryStrategy\n#18 2137.3       |                     ^\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:42:21: warning: attribute ignored [-Wattributes]\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:42:21: note: an attribute that appertains to a type-specifier is ignored\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:44:1: error: expected primary-expression before ‘public’\n#18 2137.3    44 | public:\n#18 2137.3       | ^~~~~~\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:44:1: error: expected ‘}’ before ‘public’\n#18 2137.3 /opt/ros2_ws/src/generated/rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/memory_strategy.hpp:43:1: note: to match this ‘{’\n#18 2137.3    43 | {\n#18 2137.3       | ^\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional information</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Deprecation warning was added with <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4296363547\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/ros2/rclcpp/issues/3136\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/ros2/rclcpp/pull/3136/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/ros2/rclcpp/pull/3136\">#3136</a>. Removing the deprecation warning, and it builds correctly</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">debian12:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"gcc --version\ngcc (Debian 12.2.0-14+deb12u1) 12.2.0\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">gcc --version\ngcc (Debian 12.2.0-14+deb12u1) 12.2.0\n</code></pre></div>",
